{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>I have lifted my hand.</b> An expression of oath — 'I lift my hand to El Elyon.' So too ״בִּי נִשְׁבַּעְתִּי״ (Genesis 22) — 'I swear.' And so too ״נָתַתִּי כֶּסֶף הַשָּׂדֶה קַח מִמֶּנִּי״ (ibid. 23) — 'I give you the silver of the field; take it from me.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:42.094052544Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}